## CatalogsApi

### List available filter values
## List available filter values
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/available_filter_values?catalogId={{catalogId}}&feedId={{feedId}}&country={{country}}&language={{language}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Create catalog
## Create catalog
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "catalog_type": "<string>",
 "name": "<string>"
}


### List catalogs
## List catalogs
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json
